{{#> layout title=title page=page}}{{#*inline "content"}}
{{> components/page-header title=title subtitle="Connect a resource baseline, shared budget, experiments and a reviewed source change."}}
<nav><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="/admin/analysis/resources">Resource effectiveness</a> <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="/admin/analysis/versions">Import and inspect baselines</a> <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="/admin/analysis/evaluations">Experiments</a></nav>
<form method="post" action="/admin/analysis/campaigns" class="sp-analysis-filters">
<input type="hidden" name="operation_key" value="{{operation_key}}">
<label>Campaign name<input name="name" required maxlength="200"></label>
<label>Resource baseline<select name="baseline" required><option value="">Choose a captured resource</option>{{#each resources}}{{#if latest_revision}}<option value="{{id}}|{{latest_revision}}">{{resource_key}} · {{latest_revision}}</option>{{/if}}{{/each}}</select></label>
<label>Total budget (USD)<input type="number" name="budget_dollars" min="0.01" step="0.01" value="5.00" required></label>
<label>Objective<select name="objective"><option value="tokens">Reduce tokens</option><option value="cost">Reduce cost</option><option value="quality">Improve quality</option><option value="latency">Reduce latency</option></select></label>
<label>Quality floor (thousandths, 4000 = 4/5)<input type="number" name="minimum_quality_milli" min="1000" max="5000" value="4000" required></label>
<label>Minimum distinct paired cases per partition<input type="number" name="minimum_pairs" min="2" max="1000" value="10" required></label>
<label>Maximum iterations<input type="number" name="maximum_iterations" min="1" max="100" value="3" required></label>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="automatic" value="true"> Allow automatic follow-up development runs within this budget and iteration limit</label>
<button class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary">Create campaign</button></form>
<p>Creating a campaign does not start inference. Experiments require frozen datasets, rubrics and executable environment settings. Automatic follow-up runs are opt-in and may spend the shared budget after you launch an experiment. Recommendations must pass quality, accounting and independent holdout gates; source commits and publication require human review.</p>
<div class="sp-table"><div class="sp-table__scroll"><table class="sp-table__el"><thead><tr><th>Campaign</th><th>State</th><th>Objective</th><th>Budget account</th><th>Launch a comparison</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{#each campaigns}}<tr><td>{{policy.name}}<br><small>{{id}}</small>{{#each experiments}}<p><a href="/admin/analysis/evaluations/{{this}}">Experiment {{@index}}</a> · <a href="/admin/analysis/campaigns/{{../id}}/experiments/{{this}}/report">Download report</a></p>{{/each}}</td><td>{{status}} · generation {{generation}}</td><td>{{policy.objective}}</td><td>{{policy.budget_id}}</td><td>
<form method="post" action="/admin/analysis/campaigns/{{id}}/launch">
<input type="hidden" name="operation_key" value="{{../operation_key}}">
<label>Frozen environment and dataset<select name="template_id" required><option value="">Choose a retained experiment</option>{{#each ../templates}}<option value="{{id}}">{{spec.name}} · {{spec.execution_mode}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
<label>Candidate revision<select name="candidate_revision_id" required>{{#each candidates}}<option value="{{id}}">{{rationale}} · {{created_at}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
<button class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary">Run development comparison</button></form>
</td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="5">No campaigns. Capture a resource baseline, then define its optimization objective.</td></tr>{{/each}}
</tbody></table></div></div>
{{/inline}}{{/layout}}
